00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:38.000
if you knew what you were doing, was Berlin. Because what you had again was you had the four occupation zones were still intact, but they were unmarked borders. And by unmarked, what I mean is there wasn't a hard border, there wasn't armed guards there that were checking every single person that was going through. Because what your younger listeners have to remember is, especially if they live in a city or a big town, if they think about where they have to go to every day to get to go and do things, whether it's going to the dentist, going to school, their parents going to work,
如果你知道你在做什么，那就是柏林。因为你再次拥有的是四个占领区仍然完好无所谓，但它们是未标明的边境。所谓未标明，我的意思是那里没有硬边界，那里没有武装警卫检查每一个过境的人。因为你们年轻的听众必须记住的是，特别是如果他们住在城市或大镇，如果他们想想他们每天必须去哪里去做事情，无论是去牙医那里、去学校，他们的父母去上班，

