00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:29.000
you're carrying all your belongings to leave your life in East Germany, that's how you get across. And obviously lots of people were stopped, but thousands upon thousands of people managed to escape to a new life. And I mean, we're not skipping too far forward, but by 1961 and we're getting to the war,
